{c: Verse 1}
[G],        Hi chaal turu turu
[D],        udati kes bhuru bhuru
[C] [D],        Davya dolyavar bat dhalali
[G],        Jashi mavalatya unhat
[D],        kevadyachya banat
[C] [D] [G],        Nagin salasalali
[G] [D],        Etha kuni aas paas na
